  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "***2 beach chairs & Umbrella setup daily March-October***Welcome to our luxury beach front home located on the white sand's of Seagrove Beach on 30A. Put your chair in the sand right at the water without having to fight for a space and being 3 umbrellas deep on the public beach access. Just minutes from either the popular Seaside or Rosemary Beach, our home is ideally situated for those who want both privacy and convenience. You will find local charm in the surrounding community, but our home provides modern, comfortable elegance. Home features Master suite with private balcony and oceanfront view, king sized bed, 2nd bedroom with private bath, king sized bed with 2 cozy bunks. Main level features open floor plan with additional oceanfront balcony, kitchen with quartz counter tops, and stainless appliances. Hardwood floors throughout with no carpet. Covered parking to keep your vehicle cool and out of the elements. No golf carts allowed on Walton Dunes grounds.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Walton Dunes Oceanfront-Private Beach! Daily Chair and Umbrella Setup Included!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
